guarantee: I9/I10 (review r1 #1): a declaration replayed for the call leaves the writer's device state alone, so a track that reopened before the replay is live at the next record start
file: crates/voicen-core/src/call/session.rs
added_by: developer round 2
test: cargo test -j 2 -p voicen-core --test call_session leaves_the_next_call_live
--- old
